<title>UK: Credit Local adds 1.0 bln Ffr to 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 1.0 bln Ffr to 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 1.0 billion French francs, lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT  **3.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    11.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.283   PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    101.658   SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **FIRST LAUNCHED ON 25.SEP.96 FOR 2.0 BLN FFR,</p>
<p>		INCREASED BY 500 MLN FFR ON 03.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BTAN OCTOBER 2001</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
